    switch(bytes) {
      4:  asm("sw x[i], 0(addr)");
      8:  asm("sd x[i], 0(addr)");
    }
    addr-=bytes;
  }
}
```

The final section of pseudocode executes atomically, and only executes if the section above completes without any exceptions or interrupts.

